    "Aportado por ti": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provided by you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple anunció que Rosetta seguirá completo hasta macOS 27 y que en macOS 28 solo quedará para algunos juegos antiguos. Dormer está preparado para cambiar a un motor Wine nativo para Apple Silicon cuando exista uno gratuito; si Rosetta deja de funcionar, la app te lo dirá claramente.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple announced that Rosetta will stay complete through macOS 27, and that in macOS 28 it will only remain for some older games. Dormer is ready to switch to a native Wine engine for Apple silicon once a free one exists; if Rosetta stops working, the app will tell you clearly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple limitará Rosetta a partir de macOS 28.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple will limit Rosetta starting with macOS 28."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple mantiene Rosetta completo hasta macOS 27. Desde macOS 28 quedará limitado, y los motores Wine actuales podrían dejar de funcionar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple keeps Rosetta complete through macOS 27. From macOS 28 it will be limited, and today's Wine engines may stop working."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple no permite redistribuir D3DMetal. Descarga el Game Porting Toolkit desde developer.apple.com con un Apple ID gratuito y elige su imagen de disco: Dormer copia solo los archivos necesarios, en tu Mac. Importarlo no lo activa: usarlo requiere un motor Wine del Game Porting Toolkit, que Dormer todavía no incluye.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple does not allow redistributing D3DMetal. Download the Game Porting Toolkit from developer.apple.com with a free Apple ID and choose its disk image: Dormer copies only the files it needs, on your Mac. Importing it does not enable it: using it requires a Game Porting Toolkit build of Wine, which Dormer does not include yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Argumentos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
