    "DirectX": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "DirectX 10 y 11 sobre Metal. Experimental: abre apps que piden Direct3D 11 real, pero puede fallar con otras. Descarga unos 19 MB la primera vez.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DirectX 10 and 11 on Metal. Experimental: it opens apps that need real Direct3D 11, but may fail with others. Downloads about 19 MB the first time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DirectX 10/11 → Metal. Crea dispositivos Direct3D 11 con el motor incluido, pero no puede dibujar en ventanas: a su winemac.drv le faltan símbolos que DXMT necesita. Se activará cuando el catálogo incluya un motor Wine compatible.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DirectX 10/11 → Metal. It creates Direct3D 11 devices with the included engine, but can't draw into windows: its winemac.drv lacks symbols DXMT needs. It will be enabled once the catalog includes a compatible Wine engine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DirectX 11 y 12 de Apple (Game Porting Toolkit). Debes importarlo tú: su licencia prohíbe redistribuirlo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple's DirectX 11 and 12 (Game Porting Toolkit). You must import it yourself: its license forbids redistribution."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DirectX 9 a 11 sobre Vulkan (MoltenVK). Sin mantenimiento activo en Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DirectX 9 to 11 on Vulkan (MoltenVK). Not actively maintained on Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doble clic o Retorno para abrir": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
